    "scenesThatPass": [
      "OKOYE: PHAMBILLI!!!\nOKOYE: Aneka, where is your spear?\nANEKA: The Princess gave me these to try out. I like them better.\nOKOYE: We are Dora Milaje. Not space cadets. Our foremothers used spears for millennia. It will not change under my watch.",
      "RAMONDA: That thing unnerves me. I feel like one day artificial intelligence is going to kill us all.\nSHURI: My A.I. isn’t like the movies, mother. It does exactly what I tell it to do.\nRAMONDA: Ah. If only children were the same.\nRAMONDA: Everyone seems to be working diligently.",
      "OKOYE: If you’re soldiers were present they’d still be choking on their furry costumes.\nRAMONDA: Show some respect you two.",
      "SHURI: Kid?\nOKOYE: We’ll be discreet.\nSHURI: I bet the scientist is working for DARPA.",
      "RIRI: Don’t touch anything.\nOKOYE: So the only other design plans for the machine are on that laptop?\nRIRI: Yeah.\nOKOYE: And you just leave it on a desk? In a car garage?"
    ]
  },
